NTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University Department of Intercollegiate Athletics has announced the 2027 Mountaineer Baseball schedule.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg"><media:title>Kendrick Family Ballpark overhead picture</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>1</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59511</s:story_id></item><item><title>Utah Hands West Virginia its First Sweep of the Season</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/volleyball-utah-hands-west-virginia-its-first-sweep-of-the-season</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/volleyball-utah-hands-west-virginia-its-first-sweep-of-the-season</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU huddles before a point while playing at Utah on Oct. 8" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The West Virginia University volleyball team (9-6, 2-3 Big 12) fell to Utah in straight sets on Thursday evening at the Jon M. Huntsman Center. The Utes won by set scores of 25-13, 27-25 and 25-20.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg"><media:title>WVU huddles before a point while playing at Utah on Oct. 8</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:19:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59510</s:story_id></item><item><title>Nickel and Mountaineer Defense Lead WVU to Top-20 Win Over BYU</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/womens-soccer-nickel-and-mountaineer-defense-lead-wvu-to-top-20-win-over-byu</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/womens-soccer-nickel-and-mountaineer-defense-lead-wvu-to-top-20-win-over-byu</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Sophia Nickel and Maya Leoni celebrate after a goal." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. (Oct. 8, 2026) – Behind a pair of goals from junior forward/defender Sophia Nickel and the defense's third-straight shutout, the No. 16-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team secured a 2-0 victory over No. 20 BYU at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium in Morgantown on Thursday night.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg"><media:title>Sophia Nickel and Maya Leoni celebrate after a goal.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:57:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59509</s:story_id></item><item><title>Men’s &amp; Women’s Basketball Select Single-Game and Mini Pack Tickets On Sale to Public Oct. 14</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/mens-basketball-mens-womens-basketball-select-single-game-and-mini-pack-tickets-on-sale-to-public-oct-14</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/mens-basketball-mens-womens-basketball-select-single-game-and-mini-pack-tickets-on-sale-to-public-oct-14</guid><category>Men's Basketball, Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Hope Coliseum" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-018669.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Single-game tickets for every WVU women's basketball home game, along with nonconference single-game tickets and Big 12 Conference mini packs for WVU men's basketball, go on sale to the general public beginning Wednesday, Oct. 14.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-018669.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-018669.jpg"><media:title>Hope Coliseum</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-018669.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59505</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set for Wahoowa Invitational</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/tennis-mountaineers-set-for-wahoowa-invitational</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/tennis-mountaineers-set-for-wahoowa-invitational</guid><category>Tennis</category><description><![CDATA